{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c8cedb797473f41d2421f1d73a276bd85d45f6c1c521193cabbb5abc0cb6866e", "ja": "いつも練習をしていた公園に集まり、\nバスケを楽しむ真美、歩、真、エレナ。\n竜宮小町の仕事を終えた亜美も混ざり、\nいっそ他の竜宮小町メンバーも呼ぶことに。\nそんなフワフワとした、日常の一幕。", "zh": "真美、步、真和艾莲娜聚在平时经常练习的公园里，\n开心地打着篮球。\n结束了龙宫小町工作的亚美也加入其中，\n索性把龙宫小町的其他成员也叫了过来。\n就这样，一段轻松惬意的日常场景悄然展开。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1000_012mam", "source_sha256": "4301432f760de3dfc3ea1f3b8d20c8ecb17391acba2bee856ceeec9908ee0b06", "ja": "まこちーん、パスパスパース！", "zh": "真哥——传球传球传——球！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "48677398139e2eb3354b48b018afe78f35a60ce5ca4a2b6b420c566582b0272a", "ja": "よし真美、シュート決めて！", "zh": "好，真美，投篮得分！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "7a327e66e5fd5decbb64bdfa935223e8421618c6113f12588ad36ebece3149cf", "ja": "ナイスパス！\n行くぜ！　ダーンクシュー！", "zh": "漂亮的传球！\n上吧！扣篮——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1003_se", "source_sha256": "78cbbaff13095f015a88072291da7805a1fdaefdc87801189a93ff870ff9a9c7", "ja": "スカッ、ガスッ！", "zh": "唰、咚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b47333ea4c8f0e22a54e0ded7c51530fd0f82ddc92b3669e3d69bdde40d6111c", "ja": "イェーイ、マイボーマイボー！\nエレナ、パース！", "zh": "耶——，我的球我的球！\n艾蕾娜，传球！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "269964eb4cf2d8a74f4e421b7f0d8bcbff05193fbc9e7c6b444d6f4e02b4f4ff", "ja": "オッケー♪　エレナの～、\nサンリズム・スリーポイントシュート！", "zh": "好耶♪这是艾丽娜的——\n阳光节奏·三分投篮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1006_se", "source_sha256": "6af417839f4fecb79d56d62dd980926af48a7d31dcb50b51cad47720dbc0ef7d", "ja": "ザシュッ……！", "zh": "唰——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "acb7b6d66d553efb81adc662a5836cb22ad33c74b5fef72d4df7e9be612b9baa", "ja": "もー！　真美ができないダンクに挑戦して\nチャンスをつぶすから、負けちゃったじゃないか！", "zh": "真是的！要不是真美硬要去挑战做不到的扣篮\n白白浪费了机会，我们怎么会输啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "d9882c36694ecc13bd7c54e4d33c3fc103a256d1e6d0c4067f81c9e980ece82c", "ja": "えー、だってやっぱズドンと決めたいし～。\n真美、最近オトナの階段昇りまくってるっしょ？", "zh": "诶——可是人家果然还是想来个砰的一下，漂亮得分嘛～  \n真美最近不是一直在大步迈上成人阶梯嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "23bbefef271d012c64607f4a9ed0a7f8245da3f10183e043e0a5dd8182148b03", "ja": "亜美がいないうちにグングン差をつけて、追いつけない\nくらいの超☆オトナになっときたいんだよね～。", "zh": "趁亚美不在的时候不断拉开差距，想变成成熟到让她怎么都追不上的超级☆大人呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "fdbbc8e5cb63698d1ad251cd27d2e84f6007caba7375b11d3d08e04b83be39b9", "ja": "んっふっふ～ん。\nそうはさせないぜ！", "zh": "哼哼哼～\n可没那么容易得逞哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "023993eae9b2c144f0ea52f7762c7fd33dbf789c1aaa547be5348d6df5521b13", "ja": "なにっ！　この声はいったい……！？\n誰だ！？　どこにいるんだ！？", "zh": "什么！这声音到底是……！？\n是谁！？在哪儿！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "1f68562326a94a87ac60b0cd429258b7678fa1cd947cbdbefd415e1642917110", "ja": "いや、完全にここにいる亜美だよね？\nあれ？　でもまだ竜宮小町のツアー中じゃなかった？", "zh": "不是，这完全就是这里的亚美吧？\n咦？不过她现在不是还在龙宫小町的巡演中吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c6178d5ecbdc5940dfe1cc61cbe65a7bcfd72cbc176bb937c8b3762cc7b09116", "ja": "衣装を青羽さんが直すからって、\nいったん戻って来てもらったんだ。", "zh": "因为青羽小姐要帮她修整衣装，\n所以让她先回来一趟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1014_011ami", "source_sha256": "86bf2a70b8e44471e6828cc7dba8b75e5ef09fe360a4807869c950b755164755", "ja": "そしたら真美がまこちん達と楽しそうなことしてるって\n聞いたから、兄ちゃんに連れてきてもらったんだよ～♪", "zh": "结果听说真美正和真他们开心地玩着什么，\n所以就让哥哥带我过来了哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "64c7b45910d2bbe1e7efdb6137e0e4cd6e63262670de93ba5d446b3208fbdefd", "ja": "それは残念でしたね、亜美さん。\nこのコートは4人用なのです。", "zh": "那真是遗憾呢，亚美。这个场地是供4人使用的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "e8f067333978adec4fc6624e375dbd2aee3b1d3a2111c9f3ffdbc58dabb865c9", "ja": "適当なこといわない。だとしても交代すればいいし。\nせっかくだから{$P$}もどうです？", "zh": "别瞎说。就算是那样，轮流来不就好了。难得有这个机会，{$P$}也来试试吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ae1d766d682e0df9d1ed716706427a4f54fe2da780677e3f1ca1e6951404ea18", "ja": "いや、遠慮しておくよ。\n突然の運動で、腰を痛めることもあるみたいだし……。", "zh": "不了，我就不参加了。\n听说突然运动的话，也可能会伤到腰……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "677e6e3524d7547d156c819b927a551005696a1a8602aef9aa9ccec769a8ddbb", "ja": "イオリ達も戻ってきてるノ？\nじゃあ、みんな呼んでチーム戦やろうヨ～！", "zh": "伊织她们也回来了吗？\n那就把大家都叫来，来场团队赛吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "afc31b2d1413e7281892183484cd60754712e4188082d53e732c0027175226d8", "ja": "いいね、やろうやろう！\nんじゃ、アタシがメッセージ入れとくね～。", "zh": "不错不错，来玩吧来玩吧！\n那我先给她们发个消息哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1020_012mam", "source_sha256": "28147a550c5649dfe4991126ffe4320d4369ffc6739a4ff0daee7f0bb8d94b7b", "ja": "ということで、いおりん達を待ってる間に～。\n亜美、ピコモンで勝負だ～！", "zh": "所以说，在等伊织她们的时候～  \n亚美，要不要用皮可兽一决胜负～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1021_011ami", "source_sha256": "a780b202c95e2f1ced809df63a08f7d3db48011c06497983dc11783311b80a9a", "ja": "いいよ～。……って、あれ？　真美、なんかめっちゃ\n強くなってない？　なにそのパラメータ！？", "zh": "好呀～……等等，诶？真美，你是不是变得超强了？那是什么参数！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1022_012mam", "source_sha256": "2e99dde2d3eb6d443712c8a49f1b9838355f46f9e4a26b982a94789a7e916690", "ja": "だから言ったっしょ？　真美はね、亜美がいないうちに\nオトナの階段を昇り降りしまくったのだー！！", "zh": "所以我不是说过嘛？真美呀，趁亚美不在的时候，\n可是把大人的阶梯上上下下爬了个遍——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1023_p", "source_sha256": "9c5ea26a26d83ff805f0f41427aab6c0402e7366ac78e663bb2a5d1079668c5a", "ja": "……昇り降りしたら戻ってしまうぞ？", "zh": "……又上又下的话，不就又回到原处了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1024_034ayu", "source_sha256": "41b6785466d9a55e47206403ede9fc5c5fcb84cdb1020a719d1736e3be3bb0d5", "ja": "あはは、ホントは初心者に負けて悔しかったから、\nやりこんだだけなのにね。", "zh": "啊哈哈，其实只是因为输给新手很不甘心，\n才拼命练习的啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1025_006mak", "source_sha256": "ad9e47a2a324c08ffde85c78ad0941509e98f83154f5f7c53d2f2fd3daa38aff", "ja": "アオは何やらせても上手かったからなぁ。\nベーゴマもすっかりマスターしてたし。", "zh": "阿青不管做什么都很擅长啊。\n连陀螺都已经玩得很熟练了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1026_018ele", "source_sha256": "b6bd67dc00c6ec832840ad11f92fdf58950cf7dab43ec27ffaef27e781e0c6e3", "ja": "もちろんバスケじゃ、ワタシ達の誰も勝てなかったし。\nまだ10歳なのにすごいよネ！", "zh": "当然，在篮球方面，我们谁也赢不了阿青。明明才10岁，真厉害呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1027_034ayu", "source_sha256": "56b6fb064ae922317ab81e4f68bf25aa7d6e0d02b5e77b7642814ef5578f7b38", "ja": "へえ、10歳だったんだ？", "zh": "原来是10岁啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1028_006mak", "source_sha256": "4b45f7c313da66f756286f53b3fafd87a5fd2f56527c96d0366ff79b242ee595", "ja": "そっか、10歳か～。10歳……。", "zh": "这样啊，10岁啊～。10岁……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1029_006mak", "source_sha256": "903a27db4eaee6f57b214580514fdc0289edc00b51649a337ca0ac5a9eee807f", "ja": "10歳！？", "zh": "10岁！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1030_034ayu", "source_sha256": "903a27db4eaee6f57b214580514fdc0289edc00b51649a337ca0ac5a9eee807f", "ja": "10歳！？", "zh": "10岁！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1031_018ele", "source_sha256": "8e116f43f38396d47e365e7c0df655b1ffe371b89d60af4c82d7b4468c1b17ff", "ja": "そうだヨ？　知らなかったノ？", "zh": "是这样呀？你不知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1032_006mak", "source_sha256": "d8d71a5250c910b4c6114c4ea04cf64c6cf1c049bfc9256e21fd630d2d9b1948", "ja": "だ、だって、身長は真美と同じくらいだったよね！？\nなんなら態度は大人っぽいくらいっていうか！！", "zh": "可、可是，身高不是和真美差不多吗！？  \n要说的话，感觉态度甚至还挺成熟的吧！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1033_034ayu", "source_sha256": "30b54f93399188f8198a4df91fc565451bf59383298ced54545790bf53d81cf8", "ja": "知らないも何も、学年は聞けないでしょ！！\n学校のこととか、なんかセンシティブだったし～！！", "zh": "我怎么可能知道，学年这种事哪能随便问啊！！\n学校的事情什么的，感觉挺敏感的嘛——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1034_p", "source_sha256": "846a049ad9d5b81ee2675752f4999c6d6c2d15be8f79ba2dc629099ae4fea1c9", "ja": "真美はその子のことライバル視してたんだよな？\n3つも年下だって、知ってるのか？", "zh": "真美把那孩子当成竞争对手了，对吧？\n她知道对方还比自己小3岁吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1035_034ayu", "source_sha256": "dcff8e51c0d6961ed672a67bd21f7bc1bd996ec4a9c055dc0bd227cf57b5978a", "ja": "いや……たぶん……\n知らないんじゃないかなぁ～？", "zh": "没有吧……大概……\n应该不知道吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_07_1036_006mak", "source_sha256": "e144bd4d5fea4deb3e27af747d979894809a8535a73e0bcfa57dc13b1b1fefb2", "ja": "よし……。エレナ、歩。\nこのことは、しばらく真美には伏せておこう。いいね！", "zh": "好……。艾莲娜、步。\n这件事暂时先瞒着真美。记住了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
